  "description": "<p data-start=\"131\" data-end=\"361\">Stap achter het stuur van exotische supercars in <em data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"211\">Need for Speed: Hot Pursuit 2</em> voor de <strong data-start=\"220\" data-end=\"241\">Nintendo GameCube</strong>. Race over spectaculaire circuits, ontwijk de politie of kruip zelf in de rol van agent in deze klassieke arcade-racer.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"410\">Een snelle en nostalgische titel voor racefans.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"415\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"441\">📦 Productinformatie</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"614\">\r\n<li data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"477\">\r\n<p data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"477\"><strong data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"457\">Platform:</strong> Nintendo GameCube</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"522\">\r\n<p data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"522\"><strong data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"490\">Titel:</strong> Need for Speed: Hot Pursuit 2</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"544\">\r\n<p data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"544\"><strong data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"535\">Genre:</strong> Racing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"589\">\r\n<p data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"589\"><strong data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"560\">Spelmodi:</strong> Singleplayer & Multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"614\">\r\n<p data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"614\"><strong data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"605\">Leeftijd:</strong> PEGI 3</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"619\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"632\">✅ Staat</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"719\">\r\n<li data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"651\">\r\n<p data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"651\">Originele disc</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"682\">\r\n<p data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"682\">Getest en volledig werkend</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"698\">\r\n<p data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"698\">Goede staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"719\">\r\n<p data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"719\">Inclusief doosje</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"792\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"822\">🚓 Waarom Hot Pursuit 2?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"980\">\r\n<li data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"859\">\r\n<p data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"859\">Iconische politieachtervolgingen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"885\">\r\n<p data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"885\">Exotische sportwagens</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"912\">\r\n<p data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"912\">Snelle arcade gameplay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"941\">\r\n<p data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"941\">Split-screen multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"980\">\r\n<p data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"980\">Gewild onder GameCube-verzamelaars</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"985\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1002\">🛡 Garantie</h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1109\">Bij Used Products ontvang je standaard garantie op je aankoop.<br data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1068\">Zorgeloos en vertrouwd tweedehands kopen.</p>",
